1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Due to poor communication skills,

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,540
how difficult life becomes,

3
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:07,420
I will share a case.

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:10,980
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad,

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:13,560
Psychologist.

6
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:17,580
Among the cases I handled,

7
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:20,940
one boy had communication...

8
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,800
He studies very well,

9
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,840
gets good marks,

10
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,600
everything is great.

11
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,560
His entire record is excellent.

12
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,560
Very good, excellent.

13
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,540
But when speaking,

14
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,880
he fears English.

15
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,160
Afraid to talk to people.

16
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:40,540
Afraid to attend coaching classes.

17
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:43,180
With so many fears,

18
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:45,420
he couldn't face interviews.

19
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,720
Attending interviews,

20
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,060
and getting rejected.

21
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:49,960
Why is this happening?

22
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:52,820
Mainly, these days,

23
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:55,440
no need to fear English.

24
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:58,740
Every subject is in English.

25
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:00,900
Even so, why is he afraid?

26
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:03,880
Because...

27
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:06,820
he views interviews through a lens.

28
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:10,360
Magnifying them with fear.

29
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:13,100
You have the subject theoretically,

30
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:16,540
but lack the way to explain it.

31
00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:18,480
You know the subject,

32
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:20,520
you can explain it,

33
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:22,740
but cannot express it.

34
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:25,340
Unable to express himself,

35
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:27,720
despite knowing all answers,

36
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:30,000
he failed many interviews.

37
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,580
I'll tell you how to practice.

